cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the hmrc R package, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hmrc: Download and Tidy HMRC Statistical Data"
abstract: >
  An R package that downloads, parses, and tidies statistical data published
  by HM Revenue and Customs (HMRC) on GOV.UK. Provides reproducible access
  to monthly tax receipts and NICs, VAT, fuel and tobacco duties, Corporation
  Tax, Stamp Duty, R&D credits, Income Tax liabilities by income range, the
  tax gap, and monthly property transactions. Returns annotated hmrc_tbl
  data frames with provenance metadata (source URL, fetch time, vintage,
  cell methods) suitable for reproducible fiscal research.
authors:
